--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. DEFINITIONS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1.1 "Aarkam Customer Portal" (or "AarkamCP") means the official cloud-hosted licensing, customer inventory, and subscription management platform operated by Licensor at https://aarkam.io/.
1.2 "Genesis Ceremony Bundle" means the cryptographically signed, dual-payload archive (.arkbundle) containing the root administrator provisioning token and the hardware-bound license certificate minted via AarkamCP.
1.3 "Cluster Hardware Fingerprint" means the unique cryptographic hash generated by the Software based on physical machine UUID, root drive controller serials, CPU architecture, and MAC addresses (e.g. "ARK-FP-...").
1.4 "Payment Status" means the commercial status verified on AarkamCP and cryptographically embedded in the license certificate:
    (a) "Paid": Grants full authorized capacity (Petabyte scale), enterprise node count, and advanced capabilities including SixFM semantic vector intelligence.
    (b) "Beta" / "Evaluation": Constrained cryptographically to a maximum of three (3) storage nodes, five (5) Terabytes of storage capacity, SixFM vector intelligence disabled, and maximum ninety (90) days validity.
1.5 "Node" means an individual physical server or virtual machine running an instance of the Abodi or Rokka daemon.

