2. GRANT OF COMMERCIAL LICENSE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2.1 Commercial Production License: Subject to the terms of this Agreement and payment of the applicable commercial subscription fees on AarkamCP, Licensor grants to Licensee a non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable, right to install and execute the Software within air-gapped on-premise datacenters or private sovereign clouds owned or leased by Licensee.
2.2 Hardware Binding: The Software is mathematically locked to the physical Cluster Hardware Fingerprint registered on AarkamCP. Deployment across cloned virtual machines or unregistered hardware is strictly prohibited and technically blocked by the cryptographic verification engine.
2.3 Community & Beta Evaluation: If the Licensee does not hold an active, paid commercial subscription on AarkamCP, the Software operates strictly under the Sovereign Beta profile, enforcing non-negotiable operational ceilings (max 3 nodes, 5 TB capacity, SixFM disabled). Any attempt to circumvent Beta containment constitutes a material breach of this Agreement.

